17,0 $ Pileus fuscous to dark watery grey with whitish margin, not stained with reddish brown spots. Spores broadly pip-shaped, cheilocystidia more or less clavate, covered with irregular, coarse excrescences, pleurocystidia absent. On decaying wood $ M. pseudoinclinata
